<title>SPAIN: Telefonica Q1 attributable up 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Telefonica Q1 attributable up 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first quarter in Telefonica de Espana in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit/loss		     58.63   vs   48.09</p>
<p> Net attributable			 27.87   vs   24.08</p>
<p> Earnings/loss per share	   29.66 ptas vs   25.63 ptas</p>
<p> Minorities				 17.51   vs    10.77</p>
<p> Operating revenue		     543.46   vs   447.70</p>
<p> Other operating revenue		 8.79   vs     9.28</p>
<p> In-house work			    23.22   vs    24.41</p>
<p> Operating expenses		    282.87   vs   219.23</p>
<p> Amortization			    149.46   vs   132.15</p>
<p> Financial results		     -49.24   vs   -46.46</p>
<p> Extraordinary results		 -22.94   vs   -24.74</p>
</text>
